# quest/007/SubWil160_00702 — «My Little Chocobo (Immortal Flames)» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: スウィフト大闘佐は冒険者にマイチョコボの入手方法を教えたい。
#. de: Swift findet, du solltest dir einen Chocobo besorgen.
#. fr: Swift Ryder veut vous expliquer comment obtenir votre chocobo personnel.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/SubWil160_00702:TEXT_SUBWIL160_00702_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Swift believes you should get yourself a chocobo."
msgstr "Стремительность считает, что вам пора обзавестись чокобо."

#. ja: 補給担当官から、軍票と引き換えに「<sheet Item 6019 0>」を受け取り、「チョコボ屋 ミミグン」に渡すと「マイチョコボ」が手に入る。頑張って軍票を貯めよう。
#. de: Um deinen persönlichen Chocobo zu erhalten, musst du bei Mimigun eine Chocobo-Lizenz der Legion vorweisen. Dieses Dokument erhältst du gegen Staatstaler bei der Quartiermeisterin der Legion. Hoffentlich hast du genug Taler beiseite gelegt ...
#. fr: Le colonel Ryder vous a dit que pour obtenir votre chocobo personnel, vous deviez d'abord acquérir <noun-fr Item 1 6019 1 1> en échange de sceaux de compagnie auprès de l'officier de la logistique, puis remettre ce document au palefrenier Mimigun. Vérifiez que vous avez assez de sceaux et passez à la caisse.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/SubWil160_00702:TEXT_SUBWIL160_00702_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "To obtain your personal chocobo, you must present Mimigun with a Flame Chocobo Issuance. This document can be obtained by exchanging company seals with the flame quartermaster. Here's hoping you have been setting aside your seals..."
msgstr "Чтобы получить личного чокобо, предъявите Мимигуну свидетельство на чокобо Пламени. Его можно получить у квартирмейстера Пламени в обмен на печати Великой компании. Надеюсь, вы уже накопили достаточно печатей..."

#. ja: ミミグンが「マイチョコボ」を連れてきた。チョコボに素敵な名前をつけてあげよう。
#. de: Mimigun präsentiert dir deinen Vogel, und es ist Liebe auf den ersten Blick. Gib deinem neuen Begleiter einen Namen, um die Sache offiziell zu machen.
#. fr: Mimigun vous a présenté votre nouvelle monture. À présent, vous devez lui choisir un nom pour créer un lien intime entre vous deux.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/SubWil160_00702:TEXT_SUBWIL160_00702_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Mimigun brings you your bird, and it is love at first sight. Name your new companion, and make it official."
msgstr "Мимигун приводит вашего чокобо, и это любовь с первого взгляда. Дайте новому спутнику имя — и всё будет по-настоящему."

#. ja: チョコボに<string $gs55>とつけた。「チョコボ屋 ミミグン」と話そう。
#. de: Du hast deinem Chocobo einen Namen gegeben. Sprich nun noch einmal mit Mimigun.
#. fr: Vous avez nommé votre chocobo “<string $gs55>”. Reparlez à Mimigun.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/SubWil160_00702:TEXT_SUBWIL160_00702_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "After much deliberation, you decide on a name worthy of the noblest steed. Inform Mimigun to complete the last of the formalities."
msgstr "После долгих раздумий вы выбрали имя, достойное благороднейшего скакуна. Сообщите его Мимигуну, чтобы завершить последние формальности."

#. ja: チョコボ屋 ミミグンと話して、チョコボ支給手続きを済ませた。<string $gs55>は、これからよい旅の友になるだろう。
#. de: Und so beginnen die Abenteuer von <string $gs1> und <if $gn4>ihrem<else>seinem</if> treuen Gefährten. Möge ihre Freund<shy>schaft ewig halten!
#. fr: Mimigun vous a remis un sifflet ainsi qu'un permis de chocobo. Maintenant que tout est en ordre, il ne vous reste plus qu'à chevaucher votre fidèle compagnon à plumes et partir ensemble à l'aventure<nbsp>!
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs55> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 55 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/007/SubWil160_00702:TEXT_SUBWIL160_00702_SEQ_04:1"
msgid "And so begins the adventures of <string $gs1> and <string $gs55>. May their friendship last for eternity!"
msgstr "Вот и начинаются приключения <string $gs1> и <string $gs55>. Пусть их дружба длится вечно!"

#. ja: ミミグンに<sheet Item 6019 0>を渡す
#. de: Chocobo-Lizenz der Legion bei Mimigun vorlegen
#. fr: Remettre <noun-fr Item 1 6019 1 1> à Mimigun
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/007/SubWil160_00702:TEXT_SUBWIL160_00702_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Present a Flame Chocobo Issuance to Mimigun."
msgstr "Предъявите Мимигуну свидетельство на чокобо Пламени."

#. ja: チョコボに名前をつける
#. de: Deinen Chocobo benennen
#. fr: Donner un nom à votre chocobo
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/007/SubWil160_00702:TEXT_SUBWIL160_00702_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Name your chocobo."
msgstr "Назовите чокобо."

#. ja: ミミグンと話す
#. de: Mit Mimigun sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Mimigun
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/007/SubWil160_00702:TEXT_SUBWIL160_00702_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Speak with Mimigun."
msgstr "Поговорите с Мимигуном."

#. ja: 貴様が噂の<split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>か……。<br>その活躍ぶりは聞いていたが、<br>なかなかの面構えじゃないか。
#. de: <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, korrekt? Wenn ich um einen Moment Eurer Zeit bitten dürfte.
#. fr: Salutations, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if></capitalize><nbsp>! Le récit de vos exploits ne cesse de circuler parmi nos rangs, vous êtes devenu<if $gn4>e</if> un modèle pour la plupart de nos recrues.
#. kind: other
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUlda… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankLimsaMaleText, row = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankGridaniaMaleText, row = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankUldahMaleText, row = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
